WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:09.196
Iris ran toward the soccer goal, her feet dribbling the ball with perfect control.

2
00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:17.468
The scent of fresh-cut grass filled her nose as she sped forward. It gave her a burst of energy.

3
00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:24.516
She faked to the right and then twisted her body left for a direct shot.

4
00:00:24.517 --> 00:00:32.106
Bam! The ball soared past the goalie's fingertips and into the net.

5
00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:36.851
"Score!" Jake high-fived Iris.

6
00:00:36.852 --> 00:00:41.261
His hand felt as hot and sweaty as her own.

7
00:00:41.262 --> 00:00:47.679
After all that running around, she hoped she didn't smell too terrible.

8
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:56.673
"Yes!" Sophia jumped up and down at Iris' side, her dark ponytail bouncing with her.

9
00:00:56.674 --> 00:01:01.926
Iris grinned. The three of them made a great team.

10
00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:10.562
Now that seventh grade was over for the year, they were free to play soccer in the park every afternoon if they wanted to.

11
00:01:10.563 --> 00:01:16.815
No homework, no projects, no after-school activities.

12
00:01:16.816 --> 00:01:25.902
The best possible summer lay ahead, filled with many more sunny afternoons and soccer games like this one.

13
00:01:25.903 --> 00:01:33.886
"Game's over!" the goalie said. "You guys won today, but we'll beat you next week." "What

14
00:01:33.887 --> 00:01:42.551
time is it?" Jake asked. He patted his pockets, looking for his phone. But

15
00:01:42.552 --> 00:01:44.796
they were empty. Iris

16
00:01:44.796 --> 00:01:52.383
shrugged. The sun still hung above the treetops, so it couldn't be that late. She

17
00:01:52.384 --> 00:01:59.780
watched as Sophia jogged over to the sideline and dug through her soccer bag for her phone. Iris

18
00:01:59.781 --> 00:02:05.515
had told her friends that her mom wouldn't let her have a phone until high school. But

19
00:02:05.516 --> 00:02:13.111
the truth was, Mama couldn't afford phones for Iris and her twin brother, Javier. Mama

20
00:02:13.111 --> 00:02:19.251
could barely afford her own phone since Papa had left the family last year. Sometimes

21
00:02:19.252 --> 00:02:25.338
Iris missed Papa's shooting goals with her on Sunday mornings. Mostly,

22
00:02:25.339 --> 00:02:30.356
though, things were easier without him around. Across

23
00:02:30.356 --> 00:02:36.176
the field Sophia pulled her phone out of her bag. "It's

24
00:02:36.177 --> 00:02:38.077
six o'clock!" "Already?"

25
00:02:38.078 --> 00:02:48.657
Iris clapped a hand over her mouth. "I've got to go. Great game, everyone!" she yelled as she ran off the field. "See

26
00:02:48.658 --> 00:02:53.525
you tomorrow, Iris!" Sophia called after her. Without

27
00:02:53.526 --> 00:02:59.400
